  referenceImageName: Mural1
  displayName: Rooted
  location: Brick courtyard wall between two buildings, next to the Entry door
  physicalSizeMeters: {x: 5.6, y: 6.603}
  story: "Heritage of the Time to Come, by Lakaz D'art from Mauritius, made for ALU in 2020. Lakaz D'art developed the concept and Masha Studio painted it.\n\nA Maasai woman travels through a forest of Malagasy baobabs, wearing garments covered in patterns from different African tribes. The mix of patterns stands for unity: pan-African dress shared by the many identities found across the continent. The giant trees and a flying car show a world where nature and technology live side by side, and where natural and cultural heritage win out.\n\nTap the trees to send a gust through them, or tap her earrings to catch the light."
  experiencePrefab: {fileID: 4686136062710758120, guid: b90627c27b07347cf83f5461a92232eb, type: 3}
